    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90441" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσωφελ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>help, assist besides, contribute to assist</i>,
